{"id":"n90935-1-7","stage":4,"title":"떠들썩하다 · 喧哗","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n90935-1-7-1","ko":"왜 이렇게 밖이 시끄럽지?","zh":"怎么外面这么吵啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이렇게","audio":"/audio/9a767a1c9118d82c3af9.mp3"}},{"text":"밖이","meaning":"外面，外边","explanation":"밖：外面，外边；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"밖","audio":"/audio/c54dd45d274b6e4660ea.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17878","senseId":"4","lemma":"밖","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"밖이","audio":"/audio/8938a3055438c4e2bd60.mp3"}},{"text":"시끄럽지?","meaning":"吵闹，喧嚣","explanation":"시끄럽다：吵闹，喧嚣；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"시끄럽다","audio":"/audio/72d1507eed9433fbf043.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15961","senseId":"1","lemma":"시끄럽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시끄럽지","audio":"/audio/8c83a31dc7d1710ed93b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"c54dd45d274b6e46","term":"밖","zh":"外面，外边","audio":"/audio/c54dd45d274b6e4660ea.mp3","entryId":"17878","definition":"不被某个包围的空间。","pronunciation":["박"]},{"id":"72d1507eed9433fb","term":"시끄럽다","zh":"吵闹，喧嚣","audio":"/audio/72d1507eed9433fbf043.mp3","entryId":"15961","definition":"声音大而嘈杂，令人听起来厌烦。","pronunciation":["시끄럽따"]}],"audio":"/audio/b67a6b4b86de6d0efbf3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n90935-1-7-2","ko":"가게 앞에서 젊은이들이 술을 마시며 떠들썩하고 있더라.","zh":"好像在店门口，有一群年轻人喝酒闹哄哄的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"가게","meaning":"店，店铺，商店","explanation":"가게：店，店铺，商店","readings":[{"term":"가게","audio":"/audio/c013538e549a4dedbd4a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17287","senseId":"1","lemma":"가게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가게","audio":"/audio/c013538e549a4dedbd4a.mp3"}},{"text":"앞에서","meaning":"前面","explanation":"앞：前面；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88648","senseId":"7","lemma":"앞","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"앞에서","audio":"/audio/f32ce1c6132ddf4cbe9d.mp3"}},{"text":"젊은이들이","meaning":"青年人，年轻人","explanation":"젊은이：青年人，年轻人；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"젊은이","audio":"/audio/0f57b2c723069e07217c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49313","senseId":"1","lemma":"젊은이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"젊은이들이","audio":"/audio/8a312a8335c28d982f01.mp3"}},{"text":"술을","meaning":"酒","explanation":"술：酒；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"술","audio":"/audio/803d2c68651ceceab94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65157","senseId":"1","lemma":"술","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"술을","audio":"/audio/8bbc7232261087ddd88e.mp3"}},{"text":"마시며","meaning":"喝，饮","explanation":"마시다：喝，饮；며：表示同时进行或并列；与 도 合用可表示“同时却、尽管”。","readings":[{"term":"마시다","audio":"/audio/dbfc687cbb29318d3ccd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64682","senseId":"1","lemma":"마시다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마시며","audio":"/audio/fba7acffc83b0a1f4b3f.mp3"}},{"text":"떠들썩하고","meaning":"喧哗，吵闹","explanation":"떠들썩하다：喧哗，吵闹；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"떠들썩하다","audio":"/audio/3311593a18696cbfbfff.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"90935","senseId":"1","lemma":"떠들썩하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"떠들썩하고","audio":"/audio/e68e536bdeb4988c2dc1.mp3"}},{"text":"있더라.","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；더라：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있더라","audio":"/audio/db6e6dea1cff19be66a6.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c013538e549a4ded","term":"가게","zh":"店，店铺，商店","audio":"/audio/c013538e549a4dedbd4a.mp3","entryId":"17287","definition":"铺放着东西来售卖的小规模铺子。","pronunciation":["가ː게"]},{"id":"ec1a6b96ce688b70","term":"앞","zh":"前面","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3","entryId":"88648","definition":"指某种环境或所处的状态。","pronunciation":["압"]},{"id":"0f57b2c723069e07","term":"젊은이","zh":"青年人，年轻人","audio":"/audio/0f57b2c723069e07217c.mp3","entryId":"49313","definition":"年纪轻的人。","pronunciation":["절므니"]},{"id":"803d2c68651cecea","term":"술","zh":"酒","audio":"/audio/803d2c68651ceceab94d.mp3","entryId":"65157","definition":"像啤酒或烧酒等那样含有酒精成分、喝后会醉的饮料。","pronunciation":["술"]},{"id":"dbfc687cbb29318d","term":"마시다","zh":"喝，饮","audio":"/audio/dbfc687cbb29318d3ccd.mp3","entryId":"64682","definition":"使水等液体流入喉咙。","pronunciation":["마시다"]},{"id":"3311593a18696cbf","term":"떠들썩하다","zh":"喧哗，吵闹","audio":"/audio/3311593a18696cbfbfff.mp3","entryId":"90935","definition":"很多人大声说笑，很嘈杂。","pronunciation":["떠들써카다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/21bfaee6d6f3398271ef.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.762,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=90935","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https